<title>USA: Designer Holdings Ltd Q1 EPS lower.</title>
<headline>Designer Holdings Ltd Q1 EPS lower.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.23		    $0.27</p>
<p> Net			  7,440		    6,557</p>
<p> Revs		     122,508		  114,636</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  32,159		   24,234</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q1 1997 results reflect 8 million more shares outstanding added by initial public offering.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 net per share results includes $0.03 attributed to reimbursement payment by Donna Karan International Inc resulting from termination of its licensing agreement with the company.</p>
